    "sentence_translations": [
      "Shopper’s Paradise – Hong Kong",
      "",
      "Hong Kong is a very famous tourist destination.",
      "But to mainland Chinese people, Hong Kong is a very popular shopping destination.",
      "Many people take weekend trips to Hong Kong to shop.",
      "Since Hong Kong is a tax-free zone, it is much cheaper to buy items there.",
      "In addition, Hong Kong is also a “free port”, and has lots of international goods from all over the world.",
      "The most popular items mainland visitors buy are cosmetics, clothing, jewelry, handbags, watches, and electronics.",
      "If you plan on visiting Hong Kong to shop, the best time to visit is December to February or July to September.",
      "However, during this time it is often very crowded in stores.",
